                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2 in No.
                    408.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <p rendition="#center">[From Los Andes, of Guayaquil, July 29, 1874.]</p>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">the question of the day</hi>.</p>
                <p>We have been requested to publish the following documents, through which will be
                    seen the result of the commission that has brought the under secretary of the
                    treasury, Doctor Salazar, to this city.</p>




